FROM golang:1.27.1-alpine@sha256:8a5910f31396cd4d89662f56c68b3ae31d374308270a1c3bd96672ee5ed43414 AS builder
ARG TARGETOS=linux
ARG TARGETARCH=amd64

# go.mod requires a toolchain newer than the pinned builder image, so allow Go
# to fetch the patched toolchain instead of failing with GOTOOLCHAIN=local.
ENV GOTOOLCHAIN=auto

WORKDIR /build

# Fetch deps first (layer cache)
COPY go.mod go.sum ./
# The module proxy occasionally drops large module zips with an HTTP/2 stream
# error, which would fail an otherwise healthy build, so retry a bounded number
# of times. go.sum verification is unchanged: every attempt re-reads and
# verifies the same modules.
RUN attempt=1; \
    until go mod download; do \
      if [ "${attempt}" -ge 3 ]; then \
        echo "go mod download failed after ${attempt} attempts" >&2; \
        exit 1; \
      fi; \
      echo "go mod download failed (attempt ${attempt}); retrying in 15s" >&2; \
      attempt=$((attempt + 1)); \
      sleep 15; \
    done; \
    echo "downloaded Go modules in ${attempt} attempt(s)"

# Build static binary
COPY . .
RUN CGO_ENABLED=0 GOOS=${TARGETOS} GOARCH=${TARGETARCH} \
    go build -trimpath -ldflags="-s -w" -o /bff ./cmd/bff

# ---- runtime ----
FROM gcr.io/distroless/static-debian12:nonroot@sha256:afa5c872c891853ca7fcf1f12c3edb23f7eeef36189728842dd51042ff57f7ab

COPY --from=builder /bff /bff

EXPOSE 8090 8443
ENTRYPOINT ["/bff"]
